        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series, Siena Door Knob Set With Traditional Wakefield Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage's Siena Knob With Wakefield Rose knobset is a great way to add the beauty of traditional design to any home. Easy to install, it fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. Available in 7 finishes in dummy, passage, privacy and keyed entry functions. Bring subtle elegance to any room of your home with the egg-shaped Siena Knob with the matching oval Wakefield Rose.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install a Schlage knob, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage knobs are study and do not tarnish, discolor, or corrode easily. Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Siena Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece knob for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 series 4000 grade 2 keyed entry function.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the F-Series Siena Schlage Door Knob Wakefield Collection:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height:  4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width:  2-27/32\" (2.84\")</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner (1/4\" radius corners)</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 1-5/8\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner Full Lip Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the knob while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Siena Knob With Wakefield Rose, Schlage F-SIE-WKF",
                "description": "Schlage Siena Knob With Wakefield Rose F-SIE-WKF - Schlage's Siena Knob With Wakefield Rose knobset is a great way to add the beauty of traditional design to any home. Easy to install, it fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses. Available in 7 finishes in dummy, passage, privacy and keyed entry functions. Bring subtle elegance to any room of your home with the egg-shaped Siena Knob with the matching oval Wakefield Rose.",
